# Every env file, whatever it is called. Deliberately broad: enumerated
# patterns miss one-off CLI pulls (e.g. .env.prodpull from `vercel env pull`),
# which is how live secrets reach a commit. Name the exceptions, not the secrets.
.env*
.vinext/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
cloudflare-env.d.ts
